                "text": "Great to join my co-chair, @RepEmiliaSykes, in sharing the BWC\u2019s priorities with the supporters of the @WCPInst this week.\n\nTogether, we\u2019re working to empower American women and families by:\n\n- Promoting women-owned small businesses\n- Expanding access to childcare and nutrition programs\n- Improving care for the elderly and women Veterans\n- Strengthening trauma and PTSD resources\n- Advancing the Women\u2019s History Museum on the National Mall",
